    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298891,298943</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フェンビーストと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Fenbeast?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>貴様ら、よくも我が元から、
『不凍の流体』を盗み出し、
我が元に顔を出せたものだな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you miserable bastards dare show your
faces before me again, even after stealing
the Unfreezing Fluid from right under my nose!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわっ、喋った！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, it talked!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、王の膝下を汚す者、
その息の根を止めるが妥当</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph. You who sully the dominion
of my lord, it is only right that you
should now draw your final breaths.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死ね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Die!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待てよ！
不凍の流体を盗んだのは
オレらじゃねってば！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, wait! We're not
the ones who stole
the Unfreezing Fluid!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それにあんたと
ケンカするために
来たんじゃねーし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And we didn't come
here to pick a fight
with you, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、何をしに来た
というのだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, for what purpose
have you come?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何をしに来たのだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For what purpose have you come?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほほう。腕試しということか？
相手になってやろう！　来い！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oho. A test of strength, you say?
Then I'll be your opponent! Come!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐっ……
たかが人間ごときに……
負ける、とは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh... A mere human...
has defeated me...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが……絶対、次は負けぬ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...next time, I will not lose...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたの力を
借りたいと思って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wanted to borrow
your strength.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは我に、おまえらの
言うことを聞けということか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you're telling me to
obey your commands?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別にそんな偉そうなこと、
言うつもりはねーけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wasn't planning on being
that cocky about it, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我を従わせたければ、
我を倒すがいい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you wish me to bend the knee
to you, you must first defeat me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結局、戦うのかよ……！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So we gotta fight you after all...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死ね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Die!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか人間ごときに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How...? A mere human...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが……約束だ……
貴様に力を貸そう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...it is a promise... I
will lend you my power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>水銀を持っているな。
それに我が魔力を宿す</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see you possess Mercury. My
magic power will reside within it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、氷狼王の眷属に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request to
the Retainer of the Ice Wolf Lord.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>偉大なる者の盟約のもと、
我に彼の者を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the Great One,
may they obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>貴様に力を与えん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I will not bestow my
power upon you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>貴様などでは
我が力を扱えるとは
思えんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I do not believe you would
be able to wield it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298380</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我を扱えるのは
強大な力を持つ術士のみ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only practitioners with great
might can wield me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が強い力を、
宿すためのマテリアルが
なければ我が力など扱いきれぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you lack any Material within which
my strength and power can reside,
you cannot fully wield my power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>298512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>凍らぬ液体があればな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though if you had a liquid
which remains unfrozen...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
